<li>Syekh Muhammad Jamil Jaho,</<li>
<li>Syekh Khatib Muhammad Ali Padang,</<li>
<li>Syekh Abdul Wahid ash-Shalihi Tabek Gadang,</<li>
<li>Syekh Muhammad Arifin al-Arsyadi Batuhampar,</<li>
<li>Syekh Alwi Koto Nan Ampek Payakumbuh,</<li>
